WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,280
I want to find a bodyguard to sign a ghost doctor contract

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:04,720
Good strength on the bloody train

3
00:00:04,920 --> 00:00:06,560
Who is the ghost doctor who is willing to follow me?

4
00:00:07,240 --> 00:00:09,240
Ghost doctor contract with high value

5
00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:11,120
This thing is actually so valuable

6
00:00:11,830 --> 00:00:13,990
You actually have such a high-end spiritual item

7
00:00:13,990 --> 00:00:15,550
If I hadn't already been employed

8
00:00:15,550 --> 00:00:17,350
I really want to sign a contract with you directly

9
00:00:17,910 --> 00:00:19,030
low-key low-key

10
00:00:19,030 --> 00:00:20,230
as you

11
00:00:20,230 --> 00:00:21,990
Of course you need to find the right bodyguards

12
00:00:21,990 --> 00:00:23,030
fortunately

13
00:00:23,030 --> 00:00:25,190
There is currently a third-level ghost doctor in the car.

14
00:00:25,190 --> 00:00:27,030
Although now in a weak state

15
00:00:27,030 --> 00:00:28,150
But the potential is good

16
00:00:28,430 --> 00:00:30,270
It's a good time for you to make a contract with him

17
00:00:30,390 --> 00:00:31,540
where is he

18
00:00:31,820 --> 00:00:33,780
Please also ask the train conductor for guidance.

19
00:00:34,260 --> 00:00:36,300
That weak third-level ghost doctor

20
00:00:37,080 --> 00:00:38,440
just in front

21
00:00:38,440 --> 00:00:40,440
The current number of survivors is eight.

22
00:00:44,040 --> 00:00:45,880
you damn rats

23
00:00:45,880 --> 00:00:49,320
Hurry up and clean up the garbage on the ground for us

24
00:00:49,320 --> 00:00:50,680
we are passengers

25
00:00:50,680 --> 00:00:53,240
Why do you need to clean the carriage?

26
00:00:53,240 --> 00:00:55,240
Isn’t this your cleaning job?
